 "build": {
  "id": "f268b2a3-20e4-49df-bf9e-9c85ff7ae167",
  "title": "3 Crypt Fiend Animation Single Target Guide",
  "description": "[overview]\nNot the best Animation build there is, just something I been working on and using since its seems to have been working. Comment any questions or concerns if you feel like it. Still doing testing too.\n\n[rotation]\n## Opener\n\n- Glacial Ward\n- Greater Grim Mandate (Greater Foul Mandate if you already have a Grim Mandate active)\n- Greater Razorice & Greater Chill of the Tomb (Optional)\n- 3 [Animate: Crypt Fiend](coa-skill:necromancer:801941)\n- Cap Runic Power with [Glacial Tap](coa-skill:necromancer:805369) or Runic Harvest\n- [Animate: Skeletal Archer](coa-skill:necromancer:805040)\n**Boss Gets Pulled**\n- [Harvest Plague](coa-skill:necromancer:501890)\n- Call of the Grave\n- [Animate: Plaguefather](coa-skill:necromancer:805048)\n- [Animate: Tomb King](coa-skill:necromancer:805044)\n- [Animate: Frost Wyrm](coa-skill:necromancer:805428)\n- [Unholy Frenzy](coa-skill:necromancer:805029)\n- Spam Command: Undead until free instant cast from Bone King\n- [Blight](coa-skill:necromancer:500217)\n- Keep uptime on [Animate: Skeletal Archer](coa-skill:necromancer:805040), [Harvest Plague](coa-skill:necromancer:501890), and [Blight](coa-skill:necromancer:500217) when debuff wears off.\n- Build with [Glacial Tap](coa-skill:necromancer:805369), Runic Harvest and, [Crypt Swarm](coa-skill:necromancer:500965) but dont overcap yourself with it.\n- Spend on Command: Undead\n- If free procs from Bone King and it wont overcap your runic power and you already have [Blight](coa-skill:necromancer:500217), spend it on [Lichfrost](coa-skill:necromancer:801722).\n- Spawn [Animate: Tomb King](coa-skill:necromancer:805044) and [Animate: Skeletal Archer](coa-skill:necromancer:805040) when off CD.\n- When [Animate: Plaguefather](coa-skill:necromancer:805048), [Animate: Tomb King](coa-skill:necromancer:805044), [Animate: Frost Wyrm](coa-skill:necromancer:805428) are all lining up again, Use Call of the Grave to make them instant free casts.\n\n[stats]\n## Priority\n\n1. Hit Rating (Get to 16% or 128/128)\n2. Spell Power = Spell Damage\n3. Critical Strike Rating (10-12%~)\n4. Haste Rating (10-12%~)\n5. Intellegence\n6. Stamina\n\n[gear]\n## Here is my current gear setup I'm working towards.\n\n**Head:** Bad Mojo Mask - Mythic Zul'Farrak - Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz\n**Neck:** Purified Necklace of the Damned - Argent Dawn - Exalted\n**Shoulders:** Mantle of Lost Hope - Mythic Blackrock Depths - Lord Roccor\n**Back:** Amplifying Cloak - Mythic Dire Maul West - Magister Kalendris\n**Chest:** Robes of the Lich - Mythic Razorfen Downs - Amnennar the Coldbringer\n**Wrists:** Crystalline Cuffs - Mythic Ragefire Chasm - Zelemar the Wrathful\n**Main Hand:** Blood-etched Blade - Mythic Blackrock Depths - Summoner's Tomb\n**Off-hand:** Scepter of Interminable Focus - Mythic Stratholme - Sothos and Jarien\n**Wand:** Skul's Ghastly Touch - Mythic Stratholme - Skul\n**Hands:** Combed Furline Handwraps - Timbermaw Hold - Exalted\n**Waist:** Clutch of Andros - Mythic Scholomance - Kirtonos the Herald\n**Legs:** Skyshroud Leggings - Mythic Lower Blackrock Spire - Highlord Omokk\n**Feet:** Kayser's Boots of Precision - Mythic Lower Blackrock Spire - War Master Voone\n**Finger:** Arcane Loop - Vendor - 600 gold\n**Finger 2:** Band of the Titans - Vendor - Mark of Triumph\n**Trinket:** Briarwood Reed - Mythic Upper Blackrock Spire - Jed Runewatcher\n**Trinket 2:** Qiraji Shell - Cenarion Circle - Revered\n\n[enchants]\n**Head:** Lesser Inscription of the Wizard (+15 Spell Power & +12 Resilience Rating)\n**Shoulders:** Inscription of Supremacy (+10 Spell Power & +8 Resilience Rating)\n**Back:** Sustaining Cloak Lining (+6 Spell Power & +5 Stamina)\n**Chest:** Scorpion Strike Gambeson (+5 Hit Rating)\n**Wrists:** Healing Power (+15 Spell Power)\n**Main Hand:** Arcane Artillery (80 Spell Power for 15 sec.)\n**Wand:** Focused Precision Scope (+8 Critical Strike Rating)\n**Hands:** Minor Haste (+10 Haste)\n**Waist:** Magus Belt Buckle (+10 Intellect)\n**Legs:** Lesser Inscription of the Wizard (+15 Spell Power & +12 Resilience Rating)\n**Feet:** Lesser Accuracy (+5 Hit Rating)\n\n[pvp]\nOnly big difference for PvP is I like to use 6 [Raise: Ghoul](coa-skill:necromancer:500971) for the healing they provide and Greater Foul Mandate for more stamina.\n\n[macros]\n#showtooltip\n/cast Command: Undead\n/cast Grave March\n\n#showtooltip\n/cast Crypt Swarm\n/cast Grave March\n\n\n(Because our pets don't want to listen sometime.)",
